    "name": "Ser Paulecrain (Knights of the Round)",
    "url": "https://finalfantasyd20.com/gamemastering/bestiary/bosses/primal-family/knights-of-the-round/",
    "image": "https://www.finalfantasyd20.com/wp-content/uploads/kni-of-round.png",
    "rawSections": {
      "HEADER": [
        "Ser Paulecrain (CR 20)",
        "LN Medium Outsider (Elvaan, Native)",
        "Init +11;"
      ],
      "DEFENSE": [
        "AC 30, touch 14, flat-footed 26 (+3 dex, +1 dodge, +8 armor, +8 natural)",
        "Hp 434 [560] (28d10+280)",
        "Fort +19, Ref +27, Will +19"
      ],
      "OFFENSE": [
        "Speed 30 ft",
        "Melee +2 Naginata +42/+37/+32 (1d8+13/19-20 x4)"
      ],
      "STATISTICS": [
        "Str 32, Dex 32, Con 30, Int 20, Wis 16, Cha 14",
        "Base Atk +28; CMB +39; CMD 60",
        "SQ Outsider Traits, Does not Breathe, Does not Eat, Does not Sleep",
        "Feats Cleave, Combat Expertise, Combat Patrol, Combat Reflexes, Dodge, Improved Critical, Improved Initiative, Iron Will, Lunge, Mobility, Power Attack, Spring Attack, Whirlwind Attack, Weapon Focus (Naginata)",
        "Skills Acrobatics +36, Bluff +33, Disguise +33, Knowledge (Local) +33, Knowledge (Nobility) +33, Knowledge (Religion) +33, Perception +34, Sense Motive +34, Sleight of Hand +36, Stealth +36, Use Magic Device +36",
        "Gear +1 Tatami-do, +2 Naginata (Abyssal Burst)"
      ],
      "SPECIAL ABILITIES": [
        "Bloodreaver (su) Once every other round, Ser Paulecrain can feast upon the essence of his enemies with but a touch. As a standard action, he makes a melee touch attack; if successful, the enemy takes 8d6 points of shadow damage, and he is healed as much. The target must also make a Fort save (DC 29), or be staggered for 1 round. If used on undead or creatures immune to shadow damage, it still functions, dealing non-elemental damage instead, and they must still roll a Fort save to negate the stagger effect. Blue Mages can learn this ability as a 6th-level spell (Knowledge: Planes DC 27).",
        "Evasion (ex) Ser Paulecrain can avoid even magical and unusual attacks with great agility. If he makes a successful Reflex saving throw against an attack that normally deals half damage on a successful save, he instead takes no damage.",
        "Shadowrend (ex) Once every 1d2+ rounds as a swift action, Ser Paulecrain can teleport adjacent to any creature within 90 ft. and may attack the creature, once, as a free action. The attack is made using the caster's full base attack bonus plus 4d6 points of shadow damage.",
        "Skyward Leap (ex) Once every 1d2+1 rounds as a standard action, Ser Paulecrain jumps from the sky and lands upon his opponent within 60 feet from himself. If he hits (+39), this foe take damage equal to quadruple Ser Paulecrain's naginata damage."
      ]
    },
